              ],
              "path": [
                "exports"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Creates an asynchronous job to export a design from Canva. Supported formats include PDF, JPG, PNG, GIF, PPTX, and MP4. Each format supports format-specific options such as quality, dimensions, page selection, and transparency."
